<title>JAPAN: Kawasaki Steel sees group oper profit up in 97/98.</title>
<headline>Kawasaki Steel sees group oper profit up in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kawasaki Steel Corp said on Thursday it expects a group operating profit of 74 billion yen in 1997/98, up from a 60.03 billion yen profit the previous year.</p>
<p>It also forecasts a parent operating profit of 64 billion yen in 1997/98, up from a 49.51 billion yen profit in the previous year.</p>
</text>
